sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Vehicle (simulator)
  participant K as Kafka
  participant I as ingest
  participant A as alert
  participant R as Redis
  participant P as Postgres
  participant API as api (WS)
  participant U as Console
  V->>K: telemetry.raw {OEM_B, soc 0.12}
  K->>I: batch
  I->>I: adapter → canonical, Bloom dedupe
  I->>K: telemetry.canonical (key vin)
  K->>A: batch
  A->>R: GEOSEARCH geo:chargers radius=range_km
  R-->>A: none reachable
  A->>R: SET NX alert:dedupe:{vin}:STRAND_RISK EX 900
  A->>K: alerts {STRAND_RISK, CRITICAL}
  A->>P: INSERT alert
  A->>R: PUBLISH events:{tenant} {type: alert}
  R-->>API: message
  API-->>U: WS frame < 5 s after step 1
  U->>API: POST /alerts/{id}/ack
  API->>P: UPDATE alert + INSERT audit_log
